  "details": "feel like captions would be a neat idea, like live captions. It’d work just like chat box where the text would be above the head but it’ll just translate what you’re saying. I’m hard of hearing due to some damage being done to it when I was younger and me not helping it by listening to my music in both ear on full volume, so this would be really helpful. I know it’s possible since I have something similar to it on my school computer but something like this on VRC could really help everyone (deaf,mute, and hard of hearing people)",
